"pos": [1497.3048095703125, 2272.958740234375], "id": 6, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.60", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudio"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "OPT_CONNECTION", "label": "可选连接", "type": "*"}], "size": [389.691650390625, 111.94864654541016], "pos": [-516.2913208007812, 1739.1168212890625], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 37, "type": "Fast Groups Bypasser (rgthree)", "properties": {"customSortAlphabet": "", "matchColors": "", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "sort": "position", "matchTitle": "", "showNav": true, "toggleRestriction": "default"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [29], "label": "提示词文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["他们说我是英雄。\n哈，英雄？英雄是给死人立的碑。\n我砍翻恶龙的那天，他们捧着花来谢我。\n我转身的瞬间，他们就把剑捅进我的后背 —— 为了王座，为了那点可怜的赏金。\n我在深渊里躺了三年。蛆虫啃我的骨头，怨念填我的心脏。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [22.323204040527344, 1323.5703125], "id": 17, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["**1. 元气少女音**\n\n> \n> 22 岁左右女性，嗓音清亮甜糯，带轻微鼻音，语速中等偏快，尾音上扬带笑意，充满活力和亲和力，像邻家妹妹在分享好东西。\n> 适用：短视频口播、美妆 / 零食带货、互动开箱\n\n**2. 温柔知性音**\n\n> \n> 28 岁女性，音质温润干净，气息平稳，语速舒缓，咬字清晰柔和，带治愈感和包容感，像深夜电台主播在轻声诉说。\n> 适用：有声书、情感电台、治愈系内容、客服安抚\n\n**3. 御姐冷艳音**\n\n> \n> 30 岁女性，音色偏低沉有磁性，共鸣靠后，语速慢而稳，尾音利落下压，带着疏离感和压迫感，像都市剧里气场全开的女总裁。\n> 适用：游戏角色、短剧反派 / 女强人、高端品牌广告\n\n**4. 磁性沙哑音**\n\n> \n> 35 岁女性，音色略带沙哑颗粒感，慵懒低回，语速缓慢，气声明显，带故事感和沧桑感，像酒吧里讲旧事的老朋友。\n> 适用：情感故事、深夜电台、怀旧类内容、纪录片旁白\n\n**5. 播音主持音**\n\n> \n> 25 岁女性，音色明亮饱满，字正腔圆，共鸣充分，语速均匀有节奏，重音清晰，正式但不僵硬，像新闻主播在播报。\n> 适用：宣传片、新闻 / 资讯播报、企业介绍、知识科普\n\n**6. 亲切妈妈音**\n\n> \n> 45 岁女性，音色柔和圆润，带微微笑意，语速偏慢，语气温暖絮叨，有生活气息和包容感，像妈妈在厨房边做饭边和你聊天。\n> 适用：家庭生活类内容、日用品 / 保健品带货、亲子场景、老年产品\n\n**补充技巧**：音色描述三要素 = 年龄感 + 音质（清亮 / 沙哑 / 磁性 / 圆润）+ 语气风格（笑意 / 冷淡 / 慵懒），再加一个具体画面比喻（\"像邻家妹妹\"\" 像酒吧老朋友 \"），生成效果最稳。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [461.00054931640625, 745.6958618164062], "pos": [-527.9690551757812, 2022.5360107421875], "id": 38, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "slot_index": 0, "links": [12, 17], "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["1a7eff7f9b0bc0de851b4b1926a38ab85137b39178e146b4935fed41b189c38f.mp3", null, null], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "audio"}, "name": "audio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "音频UI"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "AUDIOUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadAudio", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [397.69757080078125, 160], "pos": [22.82923698425293, 1074.467529296875], "id": 19, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.60", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadAudio"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [15], "label": "提示词文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["平静的讲述着"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [20.6761417388916, 1623.384521484375], "id": 18, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [{"name": "audio", "slot_index": 0, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["a